ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090427445714_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090427445714_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7d44807c81native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：葡足协将考虑C罗从轻情节尤其他已道歉，禁赛范围1-6个月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a.jpg"> </div><p>据ESPN报道，葡萄牙足协将考虑C罗处罚的全部从轻情节，禁赛范围为1-6个月。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac80435eae1cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：C罗擅自离队按规则已被预防性停赛 他与热苏斯彻底闹僵</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac806b89ce5fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：C罗声明帖无任何葡萄牙队友点赞，此前他们被指示避谈此事</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090510318808.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090510318808_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090510318808_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡媒O JOGO报道，C罗在社媒的声明帖总计已获得超过1900万点赞，但没有一个来自葡萄牙队友。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac80b4d387d5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">高雷雷：热苏斯才该被质疑，他承诺出场很不专业，C罗太单纯了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/6ab3f0011b8d5.jpg"> </div><p>46岁的国安旧将高雷雷在社媒发布长文，谈到了C罗退出集训风波。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7de3582bb6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">伊卡尔迪声明：法院已判决我和旺达离婚 驳回女方抚养费请求</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603131531248362_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603131531248362_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603131531248362_720.jpg"> </div><p>伊卡尔迪发表声明，宣布法院已判决他与旺达离婚。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7dfccd77ebnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞官方：NBA球星亚历山大成为俱乐部股东</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090224325929.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090224325929_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090224325929_720.jpg"> </div><p>马竞官方宣布，NBA球星亚历山大成为俱乐部股东。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac7a4a6005e7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">主裁判询问梅西是否可以结束比赛，梅西点头示意“吹吧，吹吧”</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090429122890.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090429122890.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090429122890.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">场边镜头拍摄到的一段画面显示，主裁判在吹响终场哨声前，还象征性地向梅西示意了一下。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac814dce7ad4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西：很想一辈子都为阿根廷队踢球 我知道自己做出了正确的决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5b48cd912a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5b48cd912a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5b48cd912a.jpg"> </div><p>梅西接受《阿斯报》采访，谈到了自己的国家队退役一事。</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac7ae656370dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">名记解读！DO：我看不出曼城如何还能继续留在英超，处罚极其严厉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610082253291962.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610082253291962.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610082253291962.jpg"> </div><p>著名记者大卫·奥恩斯坦接受Viaplay采访，谈到了他对于曼城案的看法，他非常直接地表示，自己看不到曼城留在英超的可能。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7e3c9c514cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨官方：19岁小将埃斯帕特完成续约，新合同至2030年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090241587651.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090241587651.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261009/202610090241587651.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨官方消息，俱乐部与19岁边卫埃斯帕特完成续约，新合同至2030年6月30日。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac7ae1deb8e8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不满今夏处理方式！记者：小蜘蛛决定和经纪人分手 马竞对此高兴</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者Rubén Uría消息，阿尔瓦雷斯已决定与自己的经纪人分道扬镳，后者也多次受到马竞方面的批评。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac7b0c19a07anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多家豪门争夺！卫报：曼联已经向JJ·加布里埃尔提供奖学金合同</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa94a7c6f30d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa94a7c6f30d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa94a7c6f30d.jpg"> </div><p>据《卫报》报道称，曼联已经向JJ·加布里埃尔提供奖学金合同。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7bddae51ddnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">哈兰德：无论发生什么都要保持微笑，最重要的是紧密团结在一起</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/6a8aefaf28ce1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/6a8aefaf28ce1_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/6a8aefaf28ce1_720.jpg"> </div><p>曼城和利物浦的焦点战赛前，曼城前锋哈兰德接受了俱乐部官网的采访，他谈论了相关话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7c0fd4de50native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">足坛中卫身价榜：库巴西、萨利巴唯二上亿，雅凯涨至6500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261009/202610090022456997.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261009/202610090022456997.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261009/202610090022456997.jpg"> </div><p>德国转会市场更新了足坛中卫身价情况，库巴西和萨利巴以1亿欧元并列榜首，帕乔8000万欧元第三。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-09/6ac7c346ae8adnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：拜仁准备与奥利塞谈续约，若达成协议他有望成为队内顶薪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a460e6e14a27.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_